<template>
  <div class="doc-content prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    ---<br>title: Workers 部署指南<br>description: OrigEssentials Workers API 的建置與部署<br>---<br><h1>Workers 部署指南</h1><br><h2>技術架構</h2><br><br>- <strong>平台</strong>：Cloudflare Workers<br>- <strong>資料庫</strong>：Cloudflare D1（SQLite）<br>- <strong>環境變數</strong>：Cloudflare Workers Secrets<br>- <strong>語言</strong>：TypeScript（ES2022 + WebAssembly）<br><h2>本機開發</h2><br><br>``<code>bash<br>cd panel<br><h1>安裝依賴</h1><br>npm install<br><h1>建立本地 D1 資料庫</h1><br>npx wrangler d1 create origessentials-local --local<br><h1>執行遷移</h1><br>npm run db:migrate<br><h1>啟動開發伺服器</h1><br>npm run dev<h1>預設：http://127.0.0.1:8787</h1><br></code>`<code><br><h2>生產部署</h2><br><h3>步驟一：編輯 wrangler.toml</h3><br><br></code>`<code>toml<br>name = "origessentials-panel"<br>main = "src/worker/index.ts"<br>compatibility_date = "2024-01-01"<br>compatibility_flags = ["nodejs_compat"]<br><br>[vars]<br>ENVIRONMENT = "production"<br><br>[[d1_databases]]<br>binding = "DB"<br>database_name = "origessentials"<br>database_id = "&lt;YOUR_D1_DATABASE_ID&gt;"<br>migrations_dir = "migrations"<br></code>`<code><br><h3>步驟二：設定 Secrets</h3><br><br></code>`<code>bash<h1>加密金鑰（32 位元組 Base64）</h1><br>npx wrangler secret put ENCRYPTION_KEY<br><h1>JWT 簽發金鑰</h1><br>npx wrangler secret put JWT_SECRET<br><h1>Cloudflare API Token（若需程式化操作）</h1><br>npx wrangler secret put CF_API_TOKEN<br></code>`<code><br><h3>步驟三：執行遷移</h3><br><br></code>`<code>bash<br>npx wrangler d1 migrations apply origessentials --env production<br></code>`<code><br><h3>步驟四：部署</h3><br><br></code>`<code>bash<br>npx wrangler deploy<br></code>`<code><br><h2>環境分離</h2><br><br>建議為不同環境建立獨立 Workers：<br><br>| 環境 | Worker 名稱 | 用途 |<br>|------|-------------|------|<br>| Development | </code>origessentials-dev<code> | 功能測試 |<br>| Staging | </code>origessentials-staging<code> | UAT 驗證 |<br>| Production | </code>origessentials-prod<code> | 正式服務 |<br><br>每個環境使用獨立 D1 資料庫與 Secrets。<br><h2>錯誤監控</h2><br><br>在 </code>wrangler.toml<code> 啟用 Observability：<br><br></code>`<code>toml<br>[observability]<br>enabled = true<br></code>`<code><br><br>查看日誌：<br></code>`<code>bash<br>npx wrangler tail --service origessentials-prod<br></code>``
  </div>
</template>
